<h1>Colour convention</h1>

<p class="lede">
  The colours labelling the four policies were reassigned on 8 July 2026. If you are
  holding a link, a printout or a PDF from before that date, its colour means something
  different from what this site now shows.
</p>

<h2>What changed</h2>

<p>
  Nothing about the policies themselves. Each policy is defined by four Hi/Lo settings
  across Security, Accountability, Efficiency and Innovation, and none of those moved.
  What moved is which colour names which policy.
</p>

<p>
  The colours now run in order from the most governed policy to the least, which they did
  not before.
</p>

